\@writefile{loa}{\contentsline {algocf}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {AsyncPPReconfiguration}---Live pipeline-parallelism reconfiguration with asynchronous KV cache migration. The algorithm transitions from $C_{\mathrm  {cur}}$ to $C_{\mathrm  {tgt}}$ through an \emph  {intermediate configuration} $C_{\mathrm  {int}}$ in which both old and new layers coexist, enabling continuous inference throughout the migration.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
